diff --git a/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst b/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..cf646bbe
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Fixed proxies using ``ssl_context`` instead of ``proxy_ssl_context`` to establish the
+TLS connection to an HTTPS proxy when the proxy is used in forwarding mode. Passing
+``ssl_context`` together with ``use_forwarding_for_https=True`` now raises a
+``ValueError`` since only ``proxy_ssl_context`` is used in that mode.
